        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 9</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Fulgeorne hi wi[t]an þæt hi nagan mid rihte þurh hæmedþingc wifes gemanan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">They know full well that they have no right to marry.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Fulgeorne hy witan, þæt hy nagon mid rihte þurh hæmedþing wifes gemanan.</ab>
